      "content": "I'm working on a policy briefing regarding the transition to net-zero. When weighing the rapid phase-out of fossil fuels against the risk of high energy costs and economic instability, how should governments prioritize these competing interests? Is there a way to justify prioritizing the climate transition if it causes significant short-term economic pain?",
